Package: jarvis-cli
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvisd (= @VERSION@)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mmAbdelhay/jarvis
Description: Jarvis assistant in the terminal
 The jarvis command: chat with the Jarvis agent, send one-shot requests
 and approve or deny its actions from a terminal. It talks to the jarvisd
 user service over its control socket and runs on jarvisd's Node.
